<h2><strong>Medium-range Control: Forecast (wave)</strong></h2>

<p><u>class=od; stream=wave; type=fc</u></p>

<p>Steps:</p>

<ul>
	<li>For times 00z &amp;12z: 0 to 144 by 3, 150 to 360 by 6.</li>
	<li>For times 06z &amp; 18z: 0 to 144 by 3.&nbsp;(From IFS Cycle 50r1, data for 06z/18z is available under "stream=wave" replacing the former "stream=scwv".)</li>
</ul>

<p>Type of level data: Surface (sfc)</p>

<p>Parameters: as described below</p>

