<h2><strong>Medium-range Ensemble: Tropical Cyclones Tracks</strong></h2>

<p><u>class=od; stream=enfo; type=tf</u></p>

<p>The tropical cyclone trajectories are computed independently for each ensemble member; a given tropical cyclone may dissipate at different times in different members, so the number of members predicting a given tropical cyclone may vary through the forecast.</p>

<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
	<thead>
		<tr>
			<th scope="col">Long name</th>
			<th scope="col">Format</th>
			<th scope="col"><strong>&nbsp;Type of&nbsp;level</strong></th>
			<th scope="col">Steps for times 00 &amp;12</th>
			<th scope="col">Steps for times 06 &amp;18</th>
		</tr>
	</thead>
	<tbody>
		<tr>
			<td>
			<p>Tropical Cyclone Trajectory (TC track including genesis)</p>
			</td>
			<td>BUFR</td>
			<td>sfc</td>
			<td>up to step 360</td>
			<td>up to step 144</td>
		</tr>
	</tbody>
</table>

